1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,461
The Organism: it's hiding inside someone.

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:04,780
Maybe the person standing right next to you.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,280
Here's how it plays.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:12,270
When placing Victims, randomly swap three of them for the Red, Black and Grey Killer

5
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:17,008
meeples. These are Exposed Victims. Nothing goes on the Killer's start space.

6
00:00:17,008 --> 00:00:20,455
Away from Station 2891, put the Lab token there instead.

7
00:00:20,675 --> 00:00:25,002
Put a Test Kit Item card face up above each Item deck, shuffle the three Test

8
00:00:25,002 --> 00:00:29,553
Results cards face down, and lay the Exposed Victim cards face down on the Killer

9
00:00:29,553 --> 00:00:29,891
board.

10
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,717
To win, you must test the Exposed Victims to find out which ones have been

11
00:00:34,717 --> 00:00:37,377
assimilated, then destroy every Mutated Organism.

12
00:00:37,597 --> 00:00:40,605
There will always be at least one, and there could be as many as three.

13
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:44,463
Exposed Victims count as Victims, with five exceptions.

14
00:00:44,683 --> 00:00:47,969
They can never be targeted or killed by a Mutated Organism.

15
00:00:47,969 --> 00:00:51,479
They can't be saved. They can't be replaced by Special Victims.

16
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:54,709
They always panic in the Panic phase, even if no one died.

17
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:59,152
And if any other effect would kill one, immediately draw a Test Results card for it

18
00:00:59,152 --> 00:00:59,559
instead.

19
00:01:00,367 --> 00:01:03,627
Testing is free: it needs no Action card and costs no Time.

20
00:01:03,627 --> 00:01:08,213
Be in the same space as an Exposed Victim, then either discard a Test Kit, or do it

21
00:01:08,213 --> 00:01:10,479
in the Lab, and draw a Test Results card.

22
00:01:10,699 --> 00:01:14,835
You get Test Kits by searching: whenever you take an Item from a Search, you may

23
00:01:14,835 --> 00:01:17,781
also take the Test Kit at that location, if one is there.

24
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:22,726
If the result is Safe, remove that card from the game and replace the meeple with a

25
00:01:22,726 --> 00:01:26,851
normal Victim. If they were tested because they'd been killed, they really are dead

26
00:01:26,851 --> 00:01:28,691
now: remove them and raise Bloodlust.

27
00:01:28,911 --> 00:01:33,056
If it's Assimilated, reveal the rightmost card on the Killer board and swap it for

28
00:01:33,056 --> 00:01:37,049
the matching Mutated Organism card. Put the meeple's token above it, set up its

29
00:01:37,049 --> 00:01:41,093
health and Final Health token, then apply all of its Bloodlust effects, from the

30
00:01:41,093 --> 00:01:42,863
lowest level up to the current one.

31
00:01:43,083 --> 00:01:46,686
Then shuffle the Assimilated card back into the Test Results deck.

32
00:01:46,686 --> 00:01:48,160
Others may be infected too.

33
00:01:48,967 --> 00:01:53,421
There are three Mutated Organisms, Fast, Strong and Tough, with five, six and seven

34
00:01:53,421 --> 00:01:55,729
health. Each has its own Bloodlust effects.

35
00:01:55,949 --> 00:02:00,091
They are Killers, not Minions. Each takes the Killer Action and Terror card actions

36
00:02:00,091 --> 00:02:04,133
as normal. With several in play, resolve them one at a time, left to right on the

37
00:02:04,133 --> 00:02:04,781
Killer board.

38
00:02:05,001 --> 00:02:09,365
Once the Finale is triggered, they also perform the extra actions marked F, straight

39
00:02:09,365 --> 00:02:10,612
after their normal ones.

40
00:02:11,433 --> 00:02:15,603
When a Mutated Organism loses its final health and another is still on the board,

41
00:02:15,603 --> 00:02:19,722
lay it on its side and finish the current phase before checking its Final Health

42
00:02:19,722 --> 00:02:20,031
token.

43
00:02:20,251 --> 00:02:23,264
If the token is blank, or it was a white token, it's dead:

44
00:02:23,264 --> 00:02:25,861
remove it. Otherwise restore its health as normal.

45
00:02:26,081 --> 00:02:30,260
You only get the plus-one Adrenaline die once, however many are on their Final

46
00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:34,760
Health. And Minor Dark Powers attach to the Organism closest to you, or wait for the

47
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:35,724
next one revealed.

48
00:02:36,533 --> 00:02:41,268
Every Finale immediately assimilates any Exposed Victims still untested, and adds a

49
00:02:41,268 --> 00:02:41,952
way to lose.

50
00:02:42,172 --> 00:02:46,699
Regenerative Assimilation: with one Organism left, raise Horror by two each Killer

51
00:02:46,699 --> 00:02:49,404
phase, and if Horror is ever above six, you lose.

52
00:02:49,624 --> 00:02:53,870
Reductive: with one left, you lose if you're in its space at the start of the Killer

53
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:58,116
phase. Cognitive: with one left, discard two Action cards each Killer phase or lose.

54
00:02:58,116 --> 00:03:02,311
And the Epic Finale: you lose if you're ever with an Organism at full health during

55
00:03:02,311 --> 00:03:03,171
the Killer phase.

56
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,627
A few tips. Test early, before the Finale assimilates everyone at once.

57
00:03:07,847 --> 00:03:11,260
Take a Test Kit every time you search, so you can test wherever you are.

58
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:15,837
Try to reveal and kill Organisms one at a time, rather than facing all three

59
00:03:15,837 --> 00:03:16,984
together. Good luck.

